but is NOT in deliverable-manifest.txt — confirm it needs no source-drift suspicion WARN task 'dcParserReadUseCaseAndFlow' looks deliverable-dependent (name) but is NOT in deliverable-manifest.txt — confirm it needs no source-drift suspicion WARN task 'dcParserSequenceSupport' looks deliverable-dependent (name) but is NOT in deliverable-manifest.txt — confirm it needs no source-drift suspicion WARN task 'dcParserSkipVisibility' looks deliverable-dependent (name) but is NOT in deliverable-manifest.txt — confirm it needs no source-drift suspicion WARN task 'rustFailLoudLints' looks deliverable-dependent (name) but is NOT in deliverable-manifest.txt — confirm it needs no source-drift suspicion WARN task 'rustS0Workspace' looks deliverable-dependent (name) but is NOT in deliverable-manifest.txt — confirm it needs no source-drift suspicion [guard:manifest-coverage] PASS — 14 scanned, 8 warning(s), 0 violation(s) [guard:critic-independence] PASS — 12808 scanned, 0 warning(s), 0 violation(s) [guard:process-skill] PASS — 23 scanned, 0 warning(s), 0 violation(s) [guard:requirement-rootedness] PASS — 3 scanned, 0 warning(s), 0 violation(s) [guard:decision-rationale] PASS — 213 scanned, 0 warning(s), 0 violation(s) WARN d0118Accept: stock affirmation ('accepted') — records agreement without recording WHAT was agreed — GRANDFATHERED (pre-issue083); state what was attested when this record is next touched WARN d0119Accept: stock affirmation ('accepted') — records agreement without recording WHAT was agreed — GRANDFATHERED (pre-issue083); state what was attested when this record is next touched WARN d0120Accept: stock affirmation ('accepted') — records agreement without recording WHAT was agreed — GRANDFATHERED (pre-issue083); state what was attested when this record is next touched WARN d0121Accept: stock affirmation ('accepted') — records agreement without recording WHAT was agreed — GRANDFATHERED (pre-issue083); state what was attested when this record is next touched WARN d01